14. Implementation Pipeline

INPUT:
    target_scene
    target_world
    source_references[]
    audience_profile?       # optional
    constraints
ANALYZE SOURCE REFERENCES:
    extract dramatic functions
    extract motif topology
    extract orchestration roles
    extract tension/release curves
    extract density and silence behavior
    extract transformation grammar
RELEASE SOURCE SURFACE:
    discard melodies
    discard recognizable phrases
    discard signature arrangements
    preserve high-level relationships
ANALYZE TARGET:
    identify characters
    identify relationships
    identify locations
    identify narrative states
    identify emotional trajectory
    identify callbacks and future payoffs
SEMANTIC ALIGNMENT:
    map source functions -> target functions
GENERATE:
    create original motif vocabulary
    create target-native orchestration
    score scene
    generate alternatives
AUDIT:
    similarity check
    narrative-function check
    originality check
    emotional-intensity check
TEST:
    scene synchronization
    listener response
    composer/director judgment
DELTA:
    retain useful discoveries
    reject accidental imitation
    update soundtrack metamap
OUTPUT:
    original target-world score

