15. The Larger Machine

Eventually:

\text{Film}
\rightarrow
\text{Narrative State}
\rightarrow
\text{Musical State}
\rightarrow
\text{Audience Response}
\rightarrow
\Delta
\rightarrow
\text{Next Musical State}

The soundtrack becomes capable of responding to the narrative at increasingly fine resolution.

Games are an obvious first habitat because their stories already change dynamically.

Eventually interactive cinema, VR, live performance, personalized films, and entirely new media could use the same architecture.

